# ── Java build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.class
out/
bin/

# ── IntelliJ IDEA ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore most of .idea/ (workspace state, local paths, caches)
# but keep the run configuration so the whole team gets it.
.idea/*
!.idea/runConfigurations/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# ── BlueJ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.ctxt
bluej.pkg

# ── Greenfoot ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# project.greenfoot → COMMIT IT (defines the scenario / World class).
# If Greenfoot rewrites it on every open and causes constant diffs, discuss
# as a team whether to ignore it and document the world class in the README.

# ── OS junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Editor backup / temp files ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
